cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Splat Trainer, please cite it as below. It was co-created with generative AI; see the README's 'Credits and AI disclosure'."
type: software
title: "How Gaussian splatting works: an interactive Splat Trainer"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-27
authors:
  - alias: adpchrgruber
repository-code: "https://github.com/adpchrgruber/adp_adv_gaussian_splatting"
url: "https://adpchrgruber.github.io/adp_adv_gaussian_splatting/"
abstract: >-
  Browser page that explains Gaussian splatting by training real 2D Gaussian splats to
  match a picture: front-to-back blending, gradient descent, densification, with
  render, ellipse and layer views and a per-splat inspector. Developed with generative
  AI assistance (Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code, Anthropic), directed and reviewed by
  the author.
keywords:
  - Gaussian splatting
  - 3D Gaussian Splatting
  - point cloud
  - teaching
  - WebGL
